@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title User - Manage Profile

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The user is signed in.

Postcondition:
The profile is updated. Email, role and status cannot
change here.
end note
:Open my profile;
|System|
:Display name, email, phone and address;
|Customer|
repeat
:Edit the name, phone or address;
:Submit the update;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Validate: name not blank, valid Vietnamese phone, address at most 500 characters;
backward :Return the validation error;
repeat while (The data is invalid?) is (Yes) not (No)
:Save the sent fields; an empty string clears the phone or address;
|Customer|
:View the new profile;
stop

@enduml
